ntroversy ,\\\\\\\" but admitted it \\\\\\\"made a mistake... we were wrong to alter the image.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nNotable thefts\\\\n\\\\n* In 1963, Robert Bradford Murphy and his wife, Elizabeth Irene Murphy were arrested and ... \\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_Archives_and_Records_Administration\\\"}],\\\"next_step\\\":\\\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\\\",\\\"observation\\\":{\\\"first_delivered_source_round\\\":null,\\\"prior_deliveries\\\":0,\\\"query_key\\\":\\\"4abebd9bef7e6d16feac2fc5be13b4bc21cac61985ee996a89a9a07ab07ac00d\\\",\\\"replay_requested\\\":false,\\\"result_fingerprint\\\":\\\"92f3359a1928cbcf55f35e1ea3a9a58c8960529cf9a324fd9d8b2d9c5de2a6fb\\\",\\\"semantic_progress\\\":\\\"not_measured\\\"},\\\"query\\\":\\\"John Murphy The 100 character wiki Emori wife married\\\",\\\"view\\\":\\\"full\\\"},{\\\"cached\\\":false,\\\"hits\\\":[{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"navigation_not_evidence\\\",\\\"navigation_seen\\\":true,\\\"previously_received\\\":true,\\\"raw_ranges_delivered\\\":[],\\\"read_action\\\":{\\\"ref\\\":\\\"d77\\\"},\\\"ref\\\":\\\"d77\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\" ... The 37-year-old singer, born in Honolulu, stands at 165 cm ( 5' 5\\\\\\\"). Some of his films include Honeymoon in Vegas and Rio 2.\\\\n\\\\n18. BD Wong – 5 feet 5 inches\\\\n\\\\nBradley Darryl Wong is an American actor of Chinese descent. Although his height is 165 cm ... \\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"https://www.legit.ng/ask-legit/1505676-short-actors-30-famous-celebrities-6-feet/\\\"},{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"navigation_not_evidence\\\",\\\"navigation_seen\\\":false,\\\"previously_received\\\":false,\\\"raw_ranges_delivered\\\":[],\\\"read_action\\\":{\\\"ref\\\":\\\"d113\\\"},\\\"ref\\\":\\\"d113\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\" ... the average height for women who participate in this industry might range between 5 feet 4 inches (163 cm) to 5 ft and 7 inches (170 cm). For instance, within the female vocalist and actor sphere, an average of a